            "heading_font_size": "heading-medium",
            "text": "<p>At SEVA each bottle is more than a product; it is a luxurious offering—crafted with purpose, guided by Ayurvedic wisdom, and designed to elevate the everyday into ritual.</p><p>We embrace timeless practices such as <strong>Dinacharya</strong> (daily routines for balance) and <strong>Swasthavritta</strong> (codes of healthful living), which remind us that caring for body and mind is an act of resilience. These rituals help maintain strength, clarity, and balance—so you can show up fully in the world.</p><p><strong>Our products are:</strong><br/><br/>• 100% natural<br/>• Hormone-conscious & free from endocrine disruptors<br/>• Free from synthetic fragrance, silicones, parabens, and fillers<br/>• Designed to restore balance, stimulate growth, and soothe from scalp to soul</p>",
