            "text": "<p><strong>Our product is proudly made in India, the birthplase of Ayurveda.</strong></p><p>This isn’t just a nod to our roots—it’s our way of giving back to our people and culture.</p><p>By choosing to manufacture in India, we support local artisans, small-batch producers, and heritage farming practices that have existed for generations. It’s our commitment to cultural sustainability- preserving ancient knowledge whilst empowering the communities behind it.</p>",
