    "section_rich_text_kFiphh": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_m3tXgt": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What SEVA Means to Us",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-medium",
            "padding_bottom": 16,
            "heading_tag": "automatic"
          }
        },
        "text_EjMLnt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In Sanskrit, <em>Seva</em> means “selfless service”—an act of<br/>love given without expectation. For us, that intention lives in the care we<br/>take with our formula. We focus on clean, pure ingredients that honor your<br/>health and wellbeing, so each ritual becomes a way to nourish, restore, and<br/>soothe—from scalp to soul—supporting you in your own rituals of care.</p><p>Each bottle is a luxurious offering, made with clean,<br/>effective ingredients and infused with purpose.</p><p>We draw on Ayurvedic wisdom to support your own wellbeing<br/>through rituals like <em>Dinacharya</em> (daily routines for balance) and <em>Swasthavritta</em><br/>(codes of healthful living). Caring for your body and mind in this way helps<br/>maintain balance, strength, and clarity-so you can show up fully in the world.</p><p>Our products are:<br/><br/>• 100% natural<br/><br/>• Hormone-conscious & free from endocrine disruptors<br/><br/>• Free from synthetic fragrance, silicones, parabens, and fillers<br/><br/>• Designed to restore balance, stimulate growth, and soothe from scalp to soul</p><p><em>As someone deeply mindful of what I put on and in my<br/>body, I found it incredibly hard to find truly clean, non-toxic products that<br/>aligned with my values. I remember walking into store after store, reading<br/>labels, researching ingredients—and leaving empty-handed. There were so few<br/>options that felt safe, honest, or inclusive.</em></p><p><em>I created SEVA to change that. To offer something real,<br/>rooted, and respectful—for those of us who’ve felt unseen in this space. I hope<br/>SEVA becomes part of a new standard in beauty: transparent, inclusive, and<br/>deeply nourishing.</em></p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-medium",
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "buttons_HtzjpB": {
          "type": "buttons",
          "settings": {
